{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39608","headline":"送僧归北岩寺 · 黄滔","name":"送僧归北岩寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北岩泉石清，本自高僧住。\n新松五十年，藤萝成古树。\n题诗昔佳士，清风二林喻。\n上智失扣关，多被浮名误。\n莲扃压月涧，空美黄金布。\n江翻岛屿沈，木落楼台露。\n伊余东还际，每起烟霞慕。\n旋爲俭府招，未得穷野步。\n西轩白云阁，师辞洞庭寓。\n越城今送归，心到焚香处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}